# 统一换行符：脚本与源码在库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 检出后 gradlew 带 CRLF 无法执行
* text=auto
*.java text eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.c text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.sha256 text eol=lf
# 交叉编译脚本与补齐的 perl 模块：必须是 LF，否则 Git Bash 里 `./build-android.sh`
# 会因为行尾的 \r 报「bad interpreter」或把 \r 带进命令行参数
*.sh text eol=lf
*.pm text eol=lf
*.pod text eol=lf
*.pl text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
